    <data key="d0">SK Telecom Next-Generation Cloud Management Platform</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ruOhUEooJH0</data>
    <data key="d2">Combines CAP (Cloud Admin Portal) using a serverless container architecture and CBP (Cloud Biz Platform) utilizing SageMaker and data lakes for BSS/OSS AI analytics.</data>
